OL,3,AMiley Cyrus marries Maxx Morando in
OL,4,ACalifornia ceremony
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiley Cyrus has married her partner of
OL,7,Ffour years Maxx Morando during a
OL,8,Fceremony in Palm Springs, California.
OL,10,FPhotos of the wedding on Saturday show
OL,11,Fthe ceremony took place by a swimming
OL,12,Fpool with the pair standing under an
OL,13,Farch covered in white flowers.
OL,15,FThe singer's mother, Tish Cyrus, and
OL,16,Fsister, Noah Cyrus, were in attendance,
OL,17,FEntertainment Tonight reported.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
